The Provider grants the User a free, non-exclusive, non-transferable permission
to install, run and evaluate the Software on devices the User owns or is
authorized to use, under these terms. No invitation or email acceptance is
required. The User may make
copies reasonably needed for installation and backup, and inspect the supplied
source code for evaluation and troubleshooting.

Playing Sidequest while doing paid or commercial coding work is permitted.
There is no purchase requirement, subscription charge or automatic conversion
to a paid plan under these terms.

